# IT Support Home Lab

## Project Objective

The objective of this project is to build a practical IT support environment using Windows, Linux, and virtual machines. I will use this lab to develop troubleshooting, user administration, networking, system security, and technical documentation skills.

## Skills I Plan to Develop

- Virtual machine installation and configuration
- Windows and Linux administration
- User and group management
- File and folder permissions
- Basic network configuration
- IT support troubleshooting
- Security configuration
- Technical documentation

## Planned Lab Environment

- Host operating system: Windows
- Virtualization platform: Oracle VirtualBox
- Virtual machines: Windows and Ubuntu Linux
- Documentation platform: GitHub

## Planned Activities

1. Install and configure virtual machines.
2. Create users and groups.
3. Configure permissions.
4. Test network connectivity.
5. Create common IT support problems.
6. Diagnose and resolve each problem.
7. Document the results with screenshots and technical notes.

## Current Status

Day 1: Workspace created, VirtualBox installed, repository created, and baseline assessment completed.
